{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is detected, approach it, check properties, grab it, perform specific task. If not, scan area or idle. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Action ID = Idle    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />",
